  "summary": "Pascal-like textual PLC language of IEC 61131-3: POUs (programs, function blocks, functions) declare typed VAR sections and use IF, CASE, FOR, WHILE and REPEAT; edition 3 adds classes, methods, interfaces and namespaces. Siemens SCL and CODESYS ST are dialects.",
  "homepage": "https://webstore.iec.ch/en/publication/68533",
  "file_extensions": [
    ".st"
  ],
  "influenced_by": [
    "pascal",
    "ada"
  ],
  "level_notes": {
    "1": "IEC 61131-3 itself is paywalled; vendor manuals (Siemens, Rockwell, CODESYS) document dialects."
  },
